<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I see the dear Redeemer raised,</l><l>I hear the speaking blood;</l><l>It speaks! My spirit is amazed!</l><l>And quickened by its flood.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I rise to walk in God’s own light</l><l>Above the world and sin,</l><l>With heart renewed and garments white</l><l>And Christ enthroned within.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
